!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = IFNgamma, 20ng/ml, 24 hours
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Cancer cell were collected, flash frozen on dry ice, and RNA was harvested using QIAGEN DAN/RNA mini kit (Cat#80204). Illumina TruSeq RNA Library Prep Kit (Cat#RS-122-2001) was used with 1 ug of total RNA for the construction of sequencing libraries.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA libraries were prepared for sequencing using standard Illumina protocols
