!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: IFNgamma
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = IFNgamma, 20ng/ml, 24 hours
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Cancer cell were collected, flash frozen on dry ice, and RNA was harvested using QIAGEN DAN/RNA mini kit (Cat#80204). Illumina TruSeq RNA Library Prep Kit (Cat#RS-122-2001) was used with 1 ug of total RNA for the construction of sequencing libraries.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA libraries were prepared for sequencing using standard Illumina protocols
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence, and masked for low-complexity or low-quality sequence, then mapped to mm10 whole genome using STAR v2.4.0 with parameters --outFilterMultimapNmax 1 --outFilterMatchNmin 35
!Sample_data_processing = Primary aligned reads were counted using htseq-count -m union -s no -t exon
!Sample_data_processing = The DESeq2 R package version 1.10 was used for differential gene expression analysis.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Matrix table with raw gene counts for every gene and every sample
